Revoke active agent sessions linked to this grant while leaving the grant itself enabled. This action uses the platform API and records audit events.

Usage:
  mcp-runtime access grant revoke-sessions [grant-name] [flags]

Flags:
  -h, --help               help for revoke-sessions
      --namespace string   Grant namespace (default "mcp-servers")

Global Flags:
      --debug      Enable debug mode with structured error logging
      --use-kube   Use direct Kubernetes mode with kubectl; requires admin/operator cluster access (admin/dev/test only)
